### ============================================
### ADMIN SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081/api/admin
### Requires: Admin authentication token

@adminBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@adminPath = /api/admin

### Get app version
GET {{adminBaseUrl}}{{adminPath}}/app/version
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update app version
PUT {{adminBaseUrl}}{{adminPath}}/app/version
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "androidVersion": "1.1",
  "androidInstallLink": "https://android.version.1.1",
  "iosVersion": "1.1",
  "iosInstallLink": "https://ios.version.1.1"
}